Chapter: PlugPow
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 INTEGER EXPONENTIATION. `^` desugars to OpPow and lowers to IrPowInt
 (Desugarer.codex:257, LoweringTypes.codex:186). The zig plug emits a call to
 its prelude's cx_ipow; the wasm plug's instruction table answers "i64.mul".

 We say:

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni ("2^10 = " & show (2 ^ 10))
    print-line-uni ("3^4  = " & show (3 ^ 4))
    print-line-uni ("5^0  = " & show (5 ^ 0))
    print-line-uni ("7^1  = " & show (7 ^ 1))
  end
